ace":"பொழுதின்","parts":[{"text":"பொழுது","lemma":"பொழுது","gloss":"time"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"locative/of"}],"gloss":"at the time of"},{"surface":"இனம்தலை","parts":[{"text":"இனம்","lemma":"இனம்","gloss":"herd"},{"text":"தலை","lemma":"தலை","gloss":"head/together"}],"gloss":"herd"},{"surface":"மயங்கி","parts":[{"text":"மயங்கு","lemma":"மயங்கு","gloss":"be confused"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"இ","gloss":"verbal participle suffix"}],"gloss":"getting confused"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கட்சி","parts":[{"text":"கட்சி","lemma":"கட்சி","gloss":"forest/dwelling"}],"gloss":"dwelling place"},{"surface":"காணா","parts":[{"text":"காணா","lemma":"காண்","gloss":"not seeing"}],"gloss":"not seeing"},{"surface":"கடமான்","parts":[{"text":"கடம்","lemma":"கடம்","gloss":"forest"},{"text":"மான்","lemma":"மான்","gloss":"deer/beast"}],"gloss":"wild cow/bison"},{"surface":"நல்லேறு","parts":[{"text":"நல்","lemma":"நன்மை","gloss":"good/fine"},{"text":"ஏறு","lemma":"ஏறு","gloss":"bull/male"}],"gloss":"fine bull"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மடமான்","parts":[{"text":"மடம்","lemma":"மடம்","gloss":"tender/innocent"},{"text":"மான்","lemma":"மான்","gloss":"deer"}],"gloss":"tender deer"},{"surface":"நாகுபிணை","parts":[{"text":"நாகு","lemma":"நாகு","gloss":"young female"},{"text":"பிணை","lemma":"பிணை","gloss":"female deer"}],"gloss":"young female mate"},{"surface":"பயிரின்","parts":[{"text":"பயிர்","lemma":"பயிர்","gloss":"call/summon"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"when/if"}],"gloss":"when calling"},{"surface":"விடர்முழை","parts":[{"text":"விடர்","lemma":"விடர்","gloss":"cleft"},{"text":"முழை","lemma":"முழை","gloss":"cave"}],"gloss":"mountain cleft"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இரும்புலி","parts":[{"text":"இரும்","lemma":"இரும்பு","gloss":"dark/large"},{"text":"புலி","lemma":"புலி","gloss":"tiger"}],"gloss":"dark tiger"},{"surface":"புகர்ப்போத்து","parts":[{"text":"புகர்","lemma":"புகர்","gloss":"spots"},{"text":"போத்து","lemma":"போத்து","gloss":"male of animal"}],"gloss":"spotted male"},{"surface":"ஓர்க்கும்","parts":[{"text":"ஓர்","lemma":"ஓர்","gloss":"examine/listen"},{"text":"க்கும்","lemma":"க்கும்","gloss":"habitual adjective suffix"}],"gloss":"listening intently"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பெருங்கல்","parts":[{"text":"பெருங்கல்","lemma":"பெருங்கல்","gloss":"great mountain"}],"gloss":"great mountain","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நாடன்","parts":[{"text":"நாடு","lemma":"நாடு","gloss":"land"},{"text":"அன்","lemma":"அன்","gloss":"he"}],"gloss":"lord of the land"},{"surface":"எம்","parts":[{"text":"எம்","lemma":"எம்","gloss":"our"}],"gloss":"our"},{"surface":"ஏறைக்கு","parts":[{"text":"ஏறை","lemma":"ஏறை","gloss":"Ēṟai"},{"text":"கு","lemma":"கு","gloss":"to"}],"gloss":"to Ēṟai"},{"surface":"தகுமே","parts":[{"text":"தகும்","lemma":"தகு","gloss":"is fitting"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"is indeed fitting"}]}],"literal":"When one's own people err, enduring that / and when others are helpless, feeling ashamed oneself / and not bringing disgrace to weapons, being strong / and walking with head held high in the assembly of kings / these are not fitting for people like you, but to our leader / whose chest is broad from drawing the bow, having a murderous spear / the great chief of the hill-dwellers who wear white lily garlands / on the high peaks of rich yield where moving clouds stay / at the time of sunset, when the herd gets confused / and a fine wild bull, unable to find its shelter / calls out to its young female tender deer, and in the mountain cleft / a spotted male of the dark tiger listens intently / the lord of such a great mountain land, to our Ēṟai, they are fitting.","translation":"To endure when one's own people err, to feel ashamed when others are helpless, to be strong without bringing disgrace to one's weapons, and to walk with head held high in the assembly of kings—these qualities are not fitting for people like you. They are fitting only for our leader, Ēṟai, whose chest is broad from drawing the bow, who holds a murderous spear, and who is the great chief of the hill-dwellers wearing white lily garlands. He is the lord of the great mountain land, where on high, fertile peaks where swirling clouds linger, at sunset, a fine wild bull that has lost its herd and cannot find its shelter calls out to its young mate, while in a deep mountain cleft, a spotted male tiger listens intently to its call.","modern":"தம் உறவினர்கள் தவறு செய்யும்போது அதனைப் பொறுத்துக் கொள்வதும், பிறர் வறுமையால் இரந்து நிற்கும்போது அதற்காகத் தான் நாணமடைவதும், போர்க்களத்தில் ஆயுதங்களுக்குப் பழி தேடாத வலிமை உடையவனாக இருப்பதும், அரசர்கள் நிறைந்த அவையிலே தலைநிமிர்ந்து நடப்பதும் ஆகிய இக்குணங்கள் உங்களைப் போன்றவர்களுக்கு உரியவை அல்ல. வில்லினை வளைத்து நாணேற்றியதால் அகன்ற மார்பினையும், கொலைத்தொழில் புரியும் வேலினையும் உடையவனும், வெண்காந்தள் மாலையை அணிந்த குறவர்களின் தலைவனுமாகிய எம் ஏறைக்கோனுக்கே இவை தகுதியுடையவை ஆகும். அசையும் மேகங்கள் தங்கும் வளம் பொருந்திய உயர்ந்த மலை உச்சியில், மாலைப் பொழுதில் தன் இனம் பிரிந்து மயங்கி, தன் இருப்பிடத்தைக் காணாத காட்டுப் பசுவின் நல்ல ஆண் ஏறு, தன் இளமையான பெண் துணையை அழைக்கும் குரலைக் கேட்டு, மலைப் பிளவிலே இருக்கும் புள்ளிகளையுடைய பெரிய ஆண் புலி உற்று நோக்கும் பெரிய மலைநாட்டிற்குத் தலைவனாகிய எம் ஏறைக்கே இக்குணங்கள் தகும்.","explanation":"The poetess Kuṟamakaḷ Iḷaveyiṉi addresses the chieftain Ēṟai in this poem, which belongs to the Pāṭāṇ tiṇai and the Iyaṉmoḻi theme, praising his natural noble qualities. She lists four supreme virtues: forgiving the mistakes of kinsmen, feeling shame at the helplessness of others, maintaining valor without bringing disgrace to weapons, and walking proudly in royal assemblies. She asserts that these high virtues are not fitting for ordinary chiefs but only for her lord, Ēṟai. The mountain landscape (Kuriñci) is described vividly to mirror his character. At sunset, a wild bull separated from its herd calls out to its mate, while a spotted tiger in a nearby cleft listens intently. This powerful image of the tiger listening to the bull's call symbolizes the constant alertness, strength, and protective nature of the mountain lord.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.98],[0.98,1.46],[1.46,1.9],[1.9,2.25],[2.25,2.51],[2.51,3.0],[3.39,4.54],[4.54,4.93],[4.93,5.31],[5.31,5.7],[5.75,6.0],[6.0,7.1],[7.1,7.4],[7.4,7.8],[7.8,8.4],[10.1,10.4],[10.4,10.78],[10.78,11.07],[11.07,11.45],[11.45,11.83],[11.83,12.3],[12.3,12.6],[12.6,13.2],[13.2,13.55],[13.55,14.03],[14.03,14.5],[14.5,14.8],[14.8,16.1],[16.1,16.4],[16.4,16.7],[16.7,17.1],[17.1,17.6],[18.73,19.16],[19.16,19.44],[19.48,20.06],[20.06,20.46],[20.46,20.96],[20.96,21.46],[21.46,21.86],[21.86,22.48],[22.48,23.1],[23.1,23.72],[23.72,24.34],[24.34,24.96],[24.96,25.66],[25.66,26.48],[26.48,27.06],[27.06,28.06],[28.06,28.46],[28.46,28.76],[28.76,29.06],[29.06,29.36]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,1.17],[1.17,1.74],[1.74,2.3],[2.3,2.92],[2.92,3.08],[3.08,3.8],[3.8,4.4],[4.4,5.09],[5.09,5.36],[5.36,6.05],[6.05,7.0],[7.0,8.1],[8.1,8.5],[8.5,8.64],[8.64,9.66],[9.66,10.85],[10.85,11.53],[11.53,12.04],[12.04,12.72],[12.72,13.4],[13.4,13.9],[13.9,14.4],[14.4,15.0],[15.0,15.6],[15.6,16.0],[16.0,16.2],[16.2,16.6],[16.6,17.9],[17.9,18.2],[18.2,18.5],[18.5,19.0],[19.0,19.5],[20.84,21.34],[21.34,21.74],[21.74,22.24],[22.24,22.88],[22.88,23.44],[23.44,23.84],[23.84,24.24],[24.24,24.93],[24.93,25.62],[25.62,26.26],[26.26,26.9],[26.9,27.54],[27.54,28.27],[28.27,29.13],[29.13,29.74],[29.74,30.04],[30.04,30.34],[30.34,30.64],[30.64,30.94],[30.94,31.24]]},"sync":[[["தமர்","one's own people"],["தன்","his/their"]],[["தப்பின்","if they err"]],[["அது","that"],["நோன்றல்லும்","and enduring"]],[["நோன்றல்லும்","and enduring"]],[["பிறர்","others"],["கையறவு","helplessness/distress"]],[["கையறவு","helplessness/distress"]],[["தான்","oneself"],["நாணுதலும்","and feeling ashamed"]],[["நாணுதலும்","and feeling ashamed"]],[["படைப்பழி","disgrace to weapons"]],[["தாரா","not bringing"]],[["மைந்தினன்","possessing strength"]],[["ஆகலும்","and being"]],[["வேந்துடை","having kings"]],[["அவை